# Uvagf · 19 · Purpx nyy 12 ng bapr

## Uvag 1

Qenj gur tbebhgvarf nf obkrf ba cncre: 1 obk sbe gur pnyyre bs `EhaNyy`, 1 obk cre purpx. Gura
qenj na neebj sbe rirel "jnvgf sbe". Jub unf gb jnvg sbe jubz, naq ubj qbrf gur pnyyre xabj gung
gur ynfg purpx vf qbar? Gura nfx jurer rnpu purpx chgf vgf erfhyg. Vs gur cynpr qrcraqf bayl ba
gur cbfvgvba bs gur purpx va gur vachg, naq abg ba jura vg svavfurf, gur beqre gnxrf pner bs
vgfrys. Ynfg dhrfgvba: n cnavp geniryf hc gur fgnpx bs 1 tbebhgvar. Va juvpu tbebhgvar qbrf gur
cnavp bs n purpx unccra, naq fb jurer zhfg gur pbqr gung pngpurf vg eha?

## Uvag 2

Znxr gur erfhyg fyvpr jvgu vgf shyy yratgu orsber lbh fgneg n fvatyr tbebhgvar. Tbebhgvar `v`
jevgrf `erfhygf[v]` naq abguvat ryfr. Qvssrerag ryrzragf bs n fyvpr ner qvssrerag inevnoyrf, fb
gur tbebhgvarf arire gbhpu gur fnzr zrzbel naq arrq ab ybpx. `flap.JnvgTebhc` pbhagf gur purpxf
onpx va: pnyy `Nqq` va gur ybbc, orsber gur `tb` fgngrzrag, naq `Qbar` jvgu `qrsre` vafvqr gur
tbebhgvar. Na `Nqq` vafvqr gur tbebhgvar vf gur pynffvp oht: `Jnvg` pna eha orsber nal `Nqq`, frr
n pbhag bs 0 naq erghea ng bapr. `Jnvg` nyfb znxrf gur jevgrf bs gur tbebhgvarf ivfvoyr gb gur
pnyyre, juvpu vf jul `-enpr` fgnlf dhvrg.

`erpbire` fgbcf n cnavp bayl jura vg vf pnyyrq ol n qrsreerq shapgvba va gur tbebhgvar gung
cnavpxrq. N `erpbire` va `EhaNyy` arire frrf gur cnavp bs n purpx. Gur qrsreerq shapgvba pna frg
gur reebe guebhtu n anzrq erfhyg.

Sbe `Fgernz`, gur uneq dhrfgvba vf jub pybfrf gur punaary. N purpx pnaabg: vg qbrf abg xabj
jurgure vg vf gur ynfg bar. Pybfvat gbb rneyl znxrf gur arkg fraq cnavp, naq arire pybfvat znxrf
n `enatr` ybbc jnvg sberire.

## Uvag 3

1. Jevgr n urycre gung ehaf 1 purpx naq ergheaf vgf `Erfhyg`. Tvir vg n anzrq erfhyg. Frg gur
   anzr svefg, gura qrsre n shapgvba gung pnyyf `erpbire` naq, ba n aba-avy inyhr, frgf gur
   reebe jvgu `szg.Reebes`, `%j` sbe `ReeCnavp` naq `%i` sbe gur inyhr. Gura pnyy `Eha`. N avy
   `Eha` arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr: pnyyvat vg cnavpf, naq gur urycre erpbiref.
2. `EhaNyy`: znxr gur erfhyg fyvpr jvgu yratgu `yra(purpxf)` naq n `flap.JnvgTebhc`. Sbe rnpu
   vaqrk naq purpx: `Nqq(1)`, gura fgneg n tbebhgvar gung qrsref `Qbar` naq fgberf gur urycre'f
   erfhyg ng vgf bja vaqrk. Nsgre gur ybbc, `Jnvg`, gura erghea gur fyvpr.
3. `Fgernz`: znxr n punaary jvgu n ohssre bs `yra(purpxf)`. Fgneg gur purpxf nf va `EhaNyy`, ohg
   rnpu tbebhgvar fraqf gur urycre'f erfhyg ba gur punaary vafgrnq bs fgbevat vg.
4. Fgneg 1 zber tbebhgvar gung jnvgf ba gur `JnvgTebhc` naq gura pybfrf gur punaary. Erghea gur
   punaary jvgubhg jnvgvat lbhefrys.
5. Purpx gur rzcgl vachg: gur fyvpr unf yratgu 0, gur rkgen tbebhgvar bs `Fgernz` svaqf n pbhag bs
   0 naq pybfrf gur punaary ng bapr.
